WEBVTT

00:00:00.610 --> 00:00:03.100
The summer vacation I was 
looking forward to so much...

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:07.620
Little did I know, our destination  
was actually another world!

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:09.990
As for my two childhood friends...

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:11.580
Hero Sink...

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:12.820
Hero Nanami...

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:14.570
Reporting for duty!

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.490
Um, what should I do?

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:20.040
Let's just have fun!

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:58.720
Pastillage Joins The Battle!

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:59.130
It appears that both armies' 
heroes are going for each other!

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:02.100
Hero Sink is dashing 
through the cog area.

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:04.560
I have about 100 days of 
experience being a hero.

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:07.310
I can't let that newbie 
hero, Nanami, beat me!

00:02:08.890 --> 00:02:11.270
That's right, show them your experience!

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:12.060
Indeed!

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:16.360
Nanami, do you think you can 
uphold your teacher's honor?

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:20.700
Of course, I mean I am 
Sink's older sister!

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:23.830
Hero Nanami is jumping into the 
fray with Her Excellency Leon,

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:28.960
but the Biscotti army 
moves in to defend!

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:58.900
All right, Sink, I won't hold back!

00:02:59.190 --> 00:03:01.280
Ready... go!

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:14.040
The hero battle has begun!

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:15.250
It's on!

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:22.180
Looks like things are 
heating up over there.

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:25.260
But still, having the hero battle steal

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:27.770
all of the attention 
is a bit unsatisfying.

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:30.390
Leon-sama, may we request a fight?

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:33.810
All right, I shall take 
you both on at once!

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:39.110
Would you like a drink?

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:40.940
The items go over here.

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:42.530
I can't believe it!

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:43.740
I know!

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:47.870
They got us!

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:49.500
We need clothes first.

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:52.670
You three! What's with that getup?!

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:54.460
You perv.

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:56.590
Don't look!

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:58.880
Like I would!

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:01.010
Oh, he was good.

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:01.920
My prince.

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:03.130
Oh, Godwin.

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:05.890
How was your fight with the hero?

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:08.850
Oh yeah, that guy's actually 
gotten quite strong.

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:14.140
He wasn't lying when he said that 
he's been training really hard.

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:16.190
Now that we also have a hero,

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:17.900
things are getting quite interesting.

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:19.020
Quite!

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:20.940
Here in the waterfall area,

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:23.650
Leon-sama and the Biscotti 
Combo are fighting!

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:27.200
Yukikaze Ninja Art: Dual Lightning Blossom!

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:41.760
Yuki!

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:44.260
Leon-sama!

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:45.630
Take this!

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:49.850
Too easy!

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:06.700
Lion King: Conflagration Explosive Slash!

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:18.960
That was really close!

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:21.750
I told you: too easy.

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:30.890
Since the Secret Squad's 
uniform is made to

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:33.270
maximize mobility, 
getting hit is dangerous!

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:36.140
That's quite right...

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:40.690
This is crazy, Sink.
 Flonyard-style war is really fun!

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:41.480
Isn't it?

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:47.450
I just knew you'd like it!

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:51.200
Yup! Leon-sama is cute and cool,

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:54.290
and all the Galettians are nice, too!

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:57.700
The Biscottians are all fun and kind...

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:03.300
I'll introduce them all 
to you and Becky later.

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:09.510
Okay, but before that,

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:13.220
I'm going to...

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:14.640
I'm gonna...

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:16.980
...win this battle!

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:24.820
Neptune Water Emblem!

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:26.650
Infernal Fire Emblem!

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:29.110
Full power!

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:43.790
Beams! They just shot beams...

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:46.710
Yes, that would be the Emblem Cannon.

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:48.630
It's a finishing move of 
the knight class fighters.

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:52.340
That's cold!

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:54.140
I'm just getting started!

00:06:56.180 --> 00:07:00.060
Our hero's in trouble! 
We have to aid him!

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:05.110
Oh no, Rico-chan's making 
a move! Archers, take aim!

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:10.700
Leon-sama herself taught 
me this Emblem Cannon...

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:30.300
Both heros' armor have been destroyed,

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:36.140
but like a true hero, the important 
parts are still covered!

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:39.930
No worries, showing you this much is okay.

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:41.640
How is that okay?!

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:45.860
It's not underwear,
 so it's not embarrassing!

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:48.320
Hero Nanami is not set back!

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:49.820
Still, it looks like the heroes

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:52.150
need to change their equipment.

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:54.700
They are both falling back, for now!

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:57.490
Right, it's still the first half;

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:59.160
we can still make it!

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:00.290
Y-yes...

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:02.750
Farkas, faster!

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:10.840
There's no mistake, 
this girl's definitely...

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:13.840
First Half of the Battle - Lunch Break
Fournette Terrace

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:16.390
Jeez, do you know how shocked I was?!

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:19.970
You could have at least explained 
some of it beforehand.

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:21.980
Come on, I already said "I'm sorry."

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:23.640
There, there, Becky.

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:25.100
Don't you worry.

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:27.190
All the things you love, like sightseeing

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:29.730
and trying different foods, are also in the plan!

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:32.360
I've also thought of a bunch of things.

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:34.660
You should come to Galette, too.

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:36.740
I'll treat you to a bunch 
of tasty fish dishes.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:40.580
Thank you so much, Leon-sama, Princess!

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:41.750
But you know,

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:44.710
you should also try joining the battle.

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:47.290
Yeah, I wanted you to join, too!

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:50.880
I'm fine, but thanks.

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:53.090
Boo, come on.

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:55.380
Fine. Don't both of you make 
the same face at once.

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:58.010
I'm enjoying myself
 enough just watching.

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:01.310
Besides...

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:05.770
I want to enjoy my nice conversation 
with the princess more.

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:07.770
Me, too!

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:10.940
Let's enjoy our girl talk!

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:13.280
Yes, let's!

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:17.450
Hey! Leo-nee, Millihi-nee!

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:18.240
A bird?

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:20.330
Couvertete? Callaway?

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:25.000
What brings you two here?

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:31.250
I wanted to- Pastillage wants 
to join this battle, too!

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:34.920
That's why we've come 
to collect that girl!

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:39.850
Yeah, you, Rebecca!

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:50.420
Now that the lunch break is over,

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:52.340
the afternoon activities can begin!

00:09:52.340 --> 00:09:54.550
Both armies have ordered their formations

00:09:54.550 --> 00:09:56.740
and are perfectly prepared!

00:09:56.940 --> 00:10:00.220
Our analysts are joining 
the afternoon battle as well!

00:10:00.930 --> 00:10:02.720
Leon-sama and Princess Millihi

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:04.810
have taken their command posts 
in their respective HQs!

00:10:05.220 --> 00:10:09.210
The princess looks so dignified in her battle clothes!

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:11.100
The afternoon's deciding 
battle is about to...

00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:13.800
Put that war on hold!

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:17.190
It's me, the First Princess of 
the Principality of Pastillage,

00:10:17.190 --> 00:10:20.300
Couverte Eschenbach Pastillage!

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:24.060
Oh, it's Couverte.

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:26.600
Cou-sama!

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:32.270
Cou-sama, what's the occasion today?

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:36.610
You know exactly what's up, Millihi-nee! 
And you, too, Leo-nee!

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:38.860
What? Me, too?

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:44.080
I know war games aren't 
that popular in our land,

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:46.620
but it's not fair that only you get

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:49.120
to summon heroes and have fun!

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:53.290
I'd be happy if you wanted to join,

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:56.000
but what should we do about 
rules and winning conditions?

00:10:57.880 --> 00:10:59.130
About that.

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:00.970
Yes?

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:06.140
My target is her!

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:10.690
I'm going to take our guest from
the other world as a hostage.

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:22.570
I fell in love with her on first sight!

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:25.120
And I'm going to seduce her!

00:11:27.990 --> 00:11:29.330
If you want her back,

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:32.040
you'll have to defeat 
Pastillage's pride,

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:33.170
the 40 airborne knights...

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:34.880
Hello.

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:40.010
...and 150 Eschenbach High Speed Cavalry

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:42.630
before you can get to me!

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:48.100
For Galette, it doesn't really 
matter where Rebecca resides.

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:52.020
Our plan is to simply defeat 
both Pastillage and Biscotti,

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:54.440
but I wonder what our hero will decide.

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:57.770
I personally want to 
get Rebecca-san back.

00:11:57.770 --> 00:12:00.690
Hero Sink, what should we do?

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:03.860
I see, so that was her plan.

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:05.160
It looks like it...

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:08.080
So you heroes have to decide.

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:09.240
I see.

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:12.910
Heroes, what do you say?!

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:16.080
We'll accept your challenge!

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:19.670
This is getting crazy!

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:22.170
Then would the representatives 
of the three countries

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:24.470
please signal the beginning of battle?

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:25.890
This battle is going to be a

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:27.550
battle royale between all three countries!

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:30.390
An all out battle for 
getting the top score!

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:32.810
The two heroes will rescue Rebecca-san!

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:38.860
The Battle of Fournette Lake, 
Afternoon Match, begins now!

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:45.280
So you were able to enter 
the fray, Bernard.

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:48.140
I am going to pin Rolan down. Let's go!

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:51.950
The Leader of the Knights, Rolan, 
is already heading for the lake area!

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:55.160
General Bernard is also rushing ahead!

00:12:57.170 --> 00:13:00.550
I'm counting on you to 
delay the heroes, Callaway.

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:01.800
Understood.

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:08.850
Liscia, can you handle that?

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:10.810
Got it, Callaway.

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:13.770
Everybody, load your rifles with Emblem Rounds!

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:14.890
Ready!

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:17.310
Fire!

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:27.450
Pastillage's airborne mage
squad is a real bother...

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:29.990
If they are left unchecked, 
our formations will be ruined.

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:32.660
I've spotted both armies' captains.

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:34.410
Initiate focus fire!

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:35.080
Aye!

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:38.420
Rolan!

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:39.960
Yes, Bernard!

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:41.750
Barrier field!

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:50.510
Aw man, it's so hard!

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:51.800
They are unscathed!

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:54.890
That was Iron Defense Rolan's 
famous protective Emblem Art!

00:13:54.890 --> 00:13:55.930
And!

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:58.440
Heavenly Cannon!

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:04.610
General Bernard's long distance Emblem Cannon!

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:06.860
It's super effective!

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:09.820
No way!

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:16.290
The two captains put up a united front!

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:19.210
Create a path for our armies by cleaving

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:20.920
into the front lines of the mage-knights!

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:22.790
Roger!

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:26.170
On this side, the Biscotti and 
Galette knights are working

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:28.170
together from the get-go!

00:14:28.170 --> 00:14:29.430
Rico-chan.

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:32.720
Vert-nee, let's go.

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:36.770
But Pastillage's mages aren't sitting idle!

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:39.390
Precision Marksman Squad! Open fire!

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:43.940
Pastillage is the technology leader!

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:47.650
Their magical research is 
the best on the continent!

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:51.490
Pastillage's unique crystal magic 
shines on the battlefield!

00:14:57.500 --> 00:15:00.830
Our fight's on hold, 
let's go rescue Becky together!

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.080
Of course!

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:04.670
Excuse me, honored heroes.

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:11.880
Rebecca-sama is a valued guest 
of my master, Couverte-sama.

00:15:11.880 --> 00:15:14.680
Right now, they are having 
an important conversation.

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:18.060
Which means that I can't let you pass.

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:25.060
Pastillage's unique Sky Knights

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:27.320
ride on giant birds named Blanchir!

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:30.610
How are the heroes going to 
fight against the Sky Knight?!

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:38.450
Emblem Sword Skill: Spinner Fire!

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:40.870
He's fast!

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:45.000
Arc Sign, go!

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:48.000
Wind Slash!

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:51.970
Thanks, Sink!

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:54.840
Nanami, can you use Bright Power Gear?

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:57.850
What? I don't know what you mean.

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:00.930
Then watch and learn.

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:03.140
Materialize the emblem and 
gather your Bright Power.

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:05.520
Then try to visualize the shape of it.

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:12.860
Tornader! Go!

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:13.990
There it is!

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:16.030
Hero Sink's Bright Power Gear!

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:18.580
The airboard Tornader!

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:24.620
I think I get the gist of it.

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:28.590
Bright Power... focus...

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:35.090
What is this?

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:37.300
Hero Nanami, too?!

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:41.930
I did it!

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:45.020
She summoned her Bright Power Gear!

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:46.190
Okay!

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:49.360
Galette's the capital of water, 
blessed by both ocean and river.

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:51.440
That's why I...

00:16:57.820 --> 00:17:00.290
am going to be the surfer hero!

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:04.790
Hero Nanami is flying!

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:07.130
Don't forget about me!

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:19.220
Now, please return Becky to us.

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:20.600
Exactly!

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:22.100
You really are heroes,

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:23.680
but it's not over yet!

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:27.850
Oh, there's something happening in 
the central battlefield as well!

00:17:27.850 --> 00:17:32.320
Boy, I thought I'd be fighting you.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:35.820
Come now, fighting together 
is quite nice, too.

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:38.910
The "Peerless" and the 
"Strongest on the continent!"

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:43.700
The strongest of Biscotti and 
Galette formed the ultimate team!

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:45.750
They both seem to enjoy themselves,

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:48.080
so should we just follow them?

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:49.630
Sounds good.

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:53.210
Oh, the leaders of the Imperial Guard and 
the Secret Squad are with them, too!

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:57.470
Does this spell certain 
doom for Pastillage?!

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:01.350
Just as I expected, our 
troops are in a real bind.

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:02.470
Looks like it...

00:18:03.010 --> 00:18:06.230
I think we have no choice but 
for you to go out there.

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:08.020
B-but you know...

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:10.400
as I said before, I really can't

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:13.860
fight like Sink or Nanami, at all.

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:18.200
Nobody said you have to fight like them.

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:22.330
Listen, Rebecca, when I saw 
you for the first time,

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:23.620
my senses tingled.

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:26.120
You have the same eyes as me.

00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:27.660
Umm...

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:31.210
You aspire to be like your friends.

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:33.130
"If only I could do that, too,

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:35.170
we could spend more time together."

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:36.630
That's what you feel.

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:40.590
I aspire to be like 
Millihi-nee and Leo-nee.

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:44.100
I want to be a wonderful ruler 
loved by my subjects, like them.

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:47.230
But, your athletic skills 
are on the sad side,

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:50.140
and I'm useless in a fight.

00:18:50.140 --> 00:18:52.610
However, in Pastillage,

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:55.900
we have something that allows 
even us to do our best!

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:59.700
Our crystal magic, and 
Pastillage's Treasure Swords:

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:03.660
Heavenly Spear Culmurth and 
Divine Sword Mercurius.

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:08.040
These are the perfect swords 
for us mages types.

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:11.960
I'm a mage type?

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:16.710
To be honest, I'm actually still training 
to be the next ruler of my land.

00:19:17.090 --> 00:19:19.510
Even though I've been 
entrusted with the sword,

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:21.380
I still have a lot to learn.

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:23.680
That might not sound encouraging,

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:26.560
but I feel like we can understand 
each other better that way.

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:28.520
I want to try a bunch of firsts with you

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:30.890
since I feel like we'll really get along.

00:19:31.350 --> 00:19:35.730
I'm honored, but are you 
sure you really want me?

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:37.400
Of course!

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:39.650
I fell in love with you!

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:42.660
I want to take to the skies with you!

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:44.410
Rebecca,

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:48.700
will you accept Pastillage's 
Divine Sword Mercurius?

00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:57.710
Something's happening on the

00:19:57.710 --> 00:19:58.920
...flying terrace.

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:01.760
Everybody, sorry for the wait.

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:04.760
And Heroes from Galette and Biscotti:

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:07.760
too bad, but you're out of time.

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:14.190
Our army's secret weapon has just been born!

00:20:16.270 --> 00:20:17.770
Go, Rebecca!

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:21.150
Equip!

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:38.350
I did it!

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:41.610
Behold!

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:46.700
This is Pastillage's 
Flying Hero, Rebecca!

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:48.570
Let's go, Rebecca!

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:53.290
Yes! I'll do my best 
as Pastillage's Hero!

00:23:30.920 --> 00:23:33.300
Hero Rebecca is born!

00:23:33.300 --> 00:23:34.040
Wonderful!

00:23:34.040 --> 00:23:35.670
I'll do my best!

00:23:35.200 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Three Heroes!</b>

00:23:35.670 --> 00:23:37.460
And, Nanami, you need to 
put some clothes on!

00:23:37.460 --> 00:23:39.520
Don't worry about it.
